@* (13) How do we know that "_Layout.cshtml is the default layout file for the views in this project?"
_ViewStart.cshtml is a special file in ASP.NET Core MVC that is executed before any view is rendered. 
The purpose of this file is to define common settings for all views in the application, such as the layout file to be used.
If you want to create a new master page, first create that in the Shared folder and then reference it here.*@

@{
    Layout = "_Layout";
}
